    "description": "Stratified split of the 831 cleaned rows (seed 2026): fit 60%, conformal 20%, test 20%. Model selection by 5-fold CV log-loss on the fit split with a one-standard-error rule favouring simpler models. Calibration method and decision thresholds are chosen on out-of-fold predictions of the fit split; final models are trained on the whole fit split. Conformal cut-offs use only the conformal split. The test split is used once, for the reported metrics (95% percentile bootstrap CIs, 2,000 resamples, paired across models).",
